  "notes": {
    "chat_template_change": "Chat template change: the Hub chat template (chat_template.json of the model) renders a video as <|vision_start|><|video_pad|><|vision_end|>. The Qwen3VLProcessor in transformers 5.22.1 replaces only <|video_pad|> and adds its own <|vision_start|>...<|vision_end|> pair around every 2-frame group, so the prompt got double vision markers (one extra outer pair around all frames). The original Qwen3-VL processor replaces the whole triple, giving <t seconds><|vision_start|>pads<|vision_end|> per group with no outer pair. Why: keep the input in the format the model expects and avoid two stray vision tokens. How: the script replaces the triple with the bare <|video_pad|> in the rendered prompt text before the processor runs; the chat_template.json file itself is not modified.",
